WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.334
The robot arm moves from the top center to the left, grasps the black bowl located between the plate and the other bowl, lifts it, and places it onto the plate.

2
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Move arm towards the black bowl and grasp it

3
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.500
Lift the bowl and move it to the left over the plate

4
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:07.000
Lower the bowl onto the plate and release the gripper
